        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Electronic, The Delgados\n- People: Bernard Sumner, Johnny Marr, Paul Savage\n- Places: England, Motherwell, North Lanarkshire, Scotland\n- Songs: \"Disappointed\"\n- Roles: singer, guitarist, drummer, record producer\n\nFacts:\n- Electronic were an English alternative dance supergroup.\n- Electronic were formed by Bernard Sumner, a New Order singer and guitarist, and Johnny Marr, an ex-Smiths guitarist.\n- The Delgados were a Scottish indie rock band from Motherwell, North Lanarkshire.\n- \"Disappointed\" was the fourth single by the English band Electronic.\n- Paul Savage is a Scottish musician and record producer.\n- Paul Savage is best known for being the drummer in the Scottish indie rock band The Delgados.",
